# Routing And Entrypoints

Reference: `src/routes/README.md`.

## Route file policy

Route files may contain:

- `Route` declaration via `createFileRoute`.
- Route-local search schemas and exported search types.
- Guards, redirects, and preloading in `beforeLoad`.
- Route-level loaders when needed.
- Component references imported from `src/entrypoints/**`.

Route files must not contain page JSX, domain component implementations, or
business orchestration hooks.

## Route layout groups

```text
src/routes/
  __root.tsx
  _auth/                         # sign-in and verify-otp
  _with-auth/                    # requires session
    _with-subscription/          # subscribed app area
    _without-subscription/       # authenticated without active subscription
  _without-auth/                 # public pages
```

## RouterContext

```typescript
type RouterContext = {
  queryClient: QueryClient;
  sessionData?: GetApiV1AuthSessionQueryResponse;
};
```

## Pattern

```typescript
import { createFileRoute } from "@tanstack/react-router";
import { zodValidator } from "@tanstack/zod-adapter";

import { MyPageComponent } from "@/entrypoints/my-page/component";
import { z } from "@/lib/zod";

const searchSchema = z.object({ q: z.string().optional() });

export const Route = createFileRoute("/_with-auth/_with-subscription/my-page")({
  validateSearch: zodValidator(searchSchema),
  beforeLoad: async ({ context }) => {
    // preload route-level data if needed
  },
  component: MyPageComponent,
});
```

## Generation workflow

- Route tree: `src/codegen/router/route-tree.gen.ts`; never edit manually.
- After route file changes: `pnpm router:generate`.
- During active route work: `pnpm router:watch`.

## Reference examples

- Route with search params:
  `src/routes/_with-auth/_with-subscription/scenarios/$scenarioId.tsx`.
- Route with optional settings search:
  `src/routes/_with-auth/_with-subscription/ideas-lists/settings.tsx`.
- Entrypoint with memoized body/footer:
  `src/entrypoints/scenario/component.tsx`.

If a new route requires an unseen guard, loader, or layout composition pattern,
ask the user before implementing it.
